&lt;div&gt;We are looking for an entrepreneurial and highly driven leader to join ROB’E as &lt;strong&gt;Head of Product &amp;amp; Strategy. &lt;/strong&gt;This role is ideal for someone who wants to take a breakthrough medical technology from early clinical proof-of-concept to a globally scalable company.&amp;nbsp;You will work closely with the founders and take increasing responsibility for strategy, product development, fundraising, and business building.&lt;/div&gt;
