&lt;li&gt;Provide support to product Test and Evaluations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute customer site assessments targeting technology infrastructure assessments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Transfer industry, technical and product knowledge to customers and colleagues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively plan to prevent pre and post sales issues to shorten time to revenue&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
