&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Develop a pipeline to help over-achieve revenue targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Direct sales activities by establishing sales territories, quotas, and goals&lt;/li&gt;
